Just wondering: 

Recently I'd made it down to the Wizard's level, and was standing in the 
center section.  Not feeling any great desire to take him on at this 
point, I zapped a wand of polymorph at him.  To my surprise, it worked, 
and he turned into a frost giant.  (One with the teleport intrinsic, 
apparently, but hey.)  He vanished, I took out the other monsters 
posthaste, and rushed forward for my reward.

To my dismay, I discovered that the Amulet of Yendor had also been 
polymorphed into...

An amulet of change.

Chagrined, I took off, ran into the Wizard/giant again, and slew him.  At 
this point I decided I was sick of the character anyway, gave up, and 
started over with a knight who _did_ eventually win.

My question is this: Has this ever happened to anyone else?  And, if so, 
did the Amulet come back when the Wizard reincarnated himself, or were you 
stuck? 
			--Doug


